<item>
            <title>[PARQUET-2498] Hadoop vector IO API doesn&apos;t handle empty list of ranges</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2498</link>
                <project id="12315521" key="PARQUET">Parquet</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Same as &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/HADOOP-19204&quot; title=&quot;VectorIO regression: empty ranges are now rejected&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;HADOOP-19204&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;HADOOP-19204&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. VectorIO regression: empty ranges are now rejected. This is triggering a failure in some tests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Change validation code to downgrade an empty list to a no-op.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
